# #54's hands-off paste items, as Live checks ran them on 2026-10-11.
# Run: scripts/harness.sh run-checklist scripts/checklists/54-paste.checklist
# Needs Lexicon Dev running with test hooks: scripts/dev-run.sh -- --test-hooks
# Item 3's tap is in item 2's window on a rerun: leave 3 minutes between runs.
issue: 54
branch: main
sha: d347832

item: paste-check lands the text in a native field and puts the clipboard back
run: paste-check
repeat: 10

item: the fn tap ignores Lexicon's own Cmd-V (no fn line over the pastes)
run: sh /usr/bin/log show --last 3m --style compact --predicate 'subsystem == "Lexicon" && category == "fn" && processImagePath CONTAINS "/Lexicon Dev.app/"'
pass: exit 0
pass: lacks [Lexicon:fn]

# The control for item 2: the same read does see the tap when a key reaches it.
item: control: a hooked fn tap shows in the same log read
run: sh "$LEXICON_HARNESS" hook fn down up >/dev/null && /usr/bin/log show --last 10s --style compact --predicate 'subsystem == "Lexicon" && category == "fn" && processImagePath CONTAINS "/Lexicon Dev.app/"'
pass: has [Lexicon:fn]
